From 22d5ea4788c176748488639a744bb2b37a29d46f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anon <>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 21:53:38 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a5xx: tile depth/stencil resources when rendering
 sysmem

RB_DEPTH_BUFFER_INFO has no tile mode field.  In bypass (sysmem) rendering
the RB on Adreno 530 writes depth/stencil in a tiled layout (2x2 blocks seen
in a CPU dump of the BO), while blits and texture sampling read the resource
as linear, so any depth blit/copy produced row-scrambled data.

With FD_DBG(SYSMEM) (the d3dkmt default) give z/s resources TILE5_3 layout so
everything agrees with the RB.  GMEM mode keeps upstream's linear z/s.

dEQP-GLES3 fbo (sysmem): 66 -> 28 failures; fbo.blit.depth_stencil 4 -> 16/16.
---
 src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_blitter.c | 12 +++++++++++-
 src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_screen.c  |  6 ++++--
 2 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_blitter.c b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_blitter.c
index 4539760..7eb89b4 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_blitter.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_blitter.c
@@ -529,7 +529,17 @@ fd5_tile_mode(const struct pipe_resource *tmpl)
    /* basically just has to be a format we can blit, so uploads/downloads
     * via linear staging buffer works:
     */
-   if (ok_format(tmpl->format))
+   /* RB_DEPTH_BUFFER_INFO has no tile mode: in sysmem (bypass) rendering the
+    * RB writes depth/stencil in TILE5_3 layout (seen on Adreno 530: 2x2
+    * blocks).  Keep z/s tiled so that sampling, blits and GMEM resolves
+    * agree with the RB.  Only when rendering sysmem (FD_DBG(SYSMEM), default
+    * on d3dkmt): in GMEM mode tiled z/s breaks GMEM restore/resolve
+    * (dEQP fbo.invalidate), so keep upstream's linear z/s there.
+    */
+   if (FD_DBG(SYSMEM) && util_format_is_depth_or_stencil(tmpl->format))
+      return TILE5_3;
+
+   if (FD_DBG(TTILE) && ok_format(tmpl->format))
       return TILE5_3;
 
    return TILE5_LINEAR;
diff --git a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_screen.c b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_screen.c
index c47fe40..dddf15c 100644
--- a/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_screen.c
+++ b/src/gallium/drivers/freedreno/a5xx/fd5_screen.c
@@ -128,8 +128,10 @@ fd5_screen_init(struct pipe_screen *pscreen)
    pscreen->is_format_supported = fd5_screen_is_format_supported;
 
    screen->layout_resource = fd5_layout_resource;
-   if (FD_DBG(TTILE))
-      screen->tile_mode = fd5_tile_mode;
+   /* fd5_tile_mode() tiles depth/stencil in sysmem mode (the RB writes z/s
+    * tiled in sysmem/bypass), everything else only with FD_DBG(TTILE).
+    */
+   screen->tile_mode = fd5_tile_mode;
 
    fd5_emit_init_screen(pscreen);
    ir3_screen_init(pscreen);
-- 
